#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
fuzzpipe (v2.1) - deterministic orchestration CLI for AI-driven EVM/Solidity invariant fuzzing.

DESIGN CONTRACT (do not break):
  * MECHANICAL ONLY. Wraps existing tools (Foundry, Medusa, Echidna, Halmos, create-chimera-app)
    and a native failing-sequence parser. Contains NO AI/LLM logic.
  * The AI reasoning (invariant discovery, harness generation, triage judgment) lives in the
    `fuzzpipe-fuzzing` skill, which CALLS this CLI. The CLI never calls the AI.
  * Every subcommand is safe to run by a human OR an agent, and NEVER crashes on a missing tool
    (a missing tool is diagnosed, not raised).

v2.1 additions over v0.2:
  * verdict gate: `verify`/`triage` lower a break to a Foundry PoC and re-execute it -> CONFIRMED
    only if it compiles + reproduces the SPECIFIC break + asserts harm; else SUSPECTED.
  * typed Invariant IR (`ir` subcommand) as the machine contract discovery->harness->gate.
  * tiered counterexample-first ladder (`run`): Tier-0 forge -> Tier-1 medusa/echidna
    -> Tier-2 halmos (eval-gated, FUZZPIPE_SYMBOLIC=1).
  * real wall-clock timeouts; version-tolerant Medusa parser; one env namespace FUZZPIPE_*.
  * shipped regression suite (`selftest`).

Subcommands:
  doctor  init  scaffold  build  gen-handlers  run  triage  verify  verify-harness  ir  coverage
  status  selftest
"""
